There are 7 days in a week, so we can find the day of the week 40 days from Tuesday by taking the remainder when 40 is divided by 7.
$40\div7=5$ with a remainder of 5, so 40 days from Tuesday will be 5 days after Tuesday.
Counting 5 days after Tuesday, we find that the answer is $\boxed{\text{Sunday}}$.The answer is: \text{Sunday}
